01:28:50.325 --> 01:28:53.089
If you have feelings for him,
you need to do something
about that.


01:28:53.161 --> 01:28:54.423
But, Daddy<i>....</i>


01:28:54.495 --> 01:28:57.760
You know how your mother
always says that
I<i>'</i>m the adventurer.


01:28:58.633 --> 01:29:02.592
Well, did you know that
when we met I didn<i>'</i>t
have a pot to piss in?


01:29:03.204 --> 01:29:04.728
I never told you this...


01:29:04.806 --> 01:29:07.900
but your grandparents
threatened to disown her
if she married me.


01:29:07.975 --> 01:29:10.637
But she defied them
and we ran off together.


01:29:11.312 --> 01:29:14.645
We didn<i>'</i>t know how we were
gonna make it. But we did.


01:29:15.683 --> 01:29:17.742
And her folks eventually
came around.


01:29:17.819 --> 01:29:21.516
The point is,
love is an adventure, Kenya.


01:29:22.323 --> 01:29:25.121
It<i>'</i>s not a decision
you make for others.


01:29:25.560 --> 01:29:28.188
It<i>'</i>s a decision
you make from the heart.


01:29:29.664 --> 01:29:33.191
Anyway, the boy is just white.
He ain<i>'</i>t a Martian.


01:29:33.334 --> 01:29:34.801
[Laughing]


01:29:35.236 --> 01:29:38.262
I mean, folks carry on
like we<i>'</i>re some kind
of pure race...


01:29:38.339 --> 01:29:39.897
that shouldn<i>'</i>t
be diluted, huh?


01:29:39.974 --> 01:29:42.340
But look at us,
all of us in this country.


01:29:42.410 --> 01:29:45.709
Black, white, brown, yellow.
We<i>'</i>re all mixed up.


01:29:46.247 --> 01:29:49.011
Mutts. All of us.
Nothing pure about us.


01:29:54.722 --> 01:29:57.054
I wish I had a father
like that.


01:29:57.425 --> 01:30:01.122
Sorry, I don<i>'</i>t lend him out.
Not even on special occasions.


01:30:01.829 --> 01:30:02.989
[Laughing]


01:30:03.498 --> 01:30:04.692
[Clock chiming]


01:30:09.470 --> 01:30:11.802
Hello, valet, can you
get me a cab?
Yes, ma<i>'</i>am.


01:30:11.873 --> 01:30:14.433
Hey, where you going?
To get Brian back.


01:30:14.509 --> 01:30:17.034
What?
That<i>'</i>s right, Brian.


01:30:17.745 --> 01:30:20.270
<i>'</i>Cause you know what?
I happen to love him.


01:30:22.984 --> 01:30:24.975
Don<i>'</i>t make love wait.
Take my car.


01:30:25.052 --> 01:30:27.520
Take my whip.
Take it, take it, take it.


01:30:28.790 --> 01:30:32.419
Just be easy on the 22s.
Be easy on the 22s.


01:30:33.027 --> 01:30:34.688
[Hip-hop music playing]


01:30:34.929 --> 01:30:36.419
Come on, now!


01:30:43.137 --> 01:30:44.627
NELSON: Oh, no!


01:30:46.107 --> 01:30:47.802
[Tires screeching]


01:30:59.754 --> 01:31:02.279
Hi.
Hi.


01:31:02.356 --> 01:31:03.948
By any chance,
have you seen Brian?


01:31:04.025 --> 01:31:06.619
Brian, I think
he<i>'</i>s gone, honey.


01:31:07.695 --> 01:31:09.026
Thank you.


01:31:44.799 --> 01:31:46.232
[Max barking]


01:31:47.068 --> 01:31:48.695
Max, I missed you.


01:31:48.769 --> 01:31:50.134
Hi, Maxie.


01:31:50.638 --> 01:31:51.832
Hi.


01:32:03.351 --> 01:32:04.443
Hi.


01:32:05.620 --> 01:32:06.678
Hey.


01:32:08.289 --> 01:32:12.953
Look, I know
you must think
I<i>'</i>m combative...


01:32:13.694 --> 01:32:17.824
neurotic, picky<i>....</i>
And maybe I am.


01:32:18.933 --> 01:32:20.958
But the weird thing is...


01:32:21.102 --> 01:32:23.662
I<i>'</i>ve never had to be
anyone but myself with you...


01:32:23.738 --> 01:32:25.467
right from the beginning.


01:32:25.540 --> 01:32:28.976
And with you I feel like
I can do anything...


01:32:29.477 --> 01:32:32.776
say anything, try anything.


01:32:36.250 --> 01:32:38.150
And that<i>'</i>s the life I want.


01:32:39.220 --> 01:32:42.986
I want an adventure with you.


01:32:46.294 --> 01:32:48.660
You don<i>'</i>t understand.
We<i>'</i>re supposed to be together.


01:32:48.729 --> 01:32:51.493
I<i>'</i>m never gonna be
your dream man, Kenya.


01:32:51.566 --> 01:32:53.591
I just<i>....</i>
I won<i>'</i>t be the fall-back guy.


01:32:53.668 --> 01:32:55.067
No. See, that<i>'</i>s the thing.


01:32:55.136 --> 01:32:58.503
I don<i>'</i>t have to wonder
about that anymore.
I know this is right.


01:32:59.440 --> 01:33:00.907
Dreams change.


01:33:01.943 --> 01:33:05.344
Hey, when I was younger,
my dream was to
marry Rick James.


01:33:06.881 --> 01:33:09.111
You<i>'</i>re the one I want, Brian.


01:33:11.552 --> 01:33:12.917
I love you.


01:33:15.189 --> 01:33:16.850
I love you, Kenya.


01:33:17.191 --> 01:33:19.421
I<i>'</i>ve never stopped
loving you.


01:33:20.261 --> 01:33:21.888
[Guitar playing]


01:33:23.531 --> 01:33:26.762
Oh, wait, wait.
We have to go right now.
There<i>'</i>s not much time left.


01:33:26.834 --> 01:33:28.734
Where?
What are we doing?


01:33:31.205 --> 01:33:33.435
Do you know that guy
with the guitar?


01:33:36.444 --> 01:33:39.106
[Family Reunion
by Jill Scott playing]


01:35:02.396 --> 01:35:05.263
MAN: Aw, shucks!


01:35:05.900 --> 01:35:07.697
WOMAN: Look at him!
Oh, my God.


01:35:08.803 --> 01:35:10.270
[Girl whooping]


01:35:22.116 --> 01:35:23.947
Photo-op, photo-op, photo-op!


01:35:24.018 --> 01:35:26.179
Everybody look at
the photographer!


01:35:32.026 --> 01:35:34.085
[All shouting]


01:35:47.675 --> 01:35:49.404
NELSON: I found her, Daddy!

